SUMMARY:Seniors in Spirit
DESCRIPTION:We meet on the second Tuesday of the month at 12:30 pm at Round Table Pizza on Occidental Road near the Center for lunch\, friendship\, prayer support\, and to plan outings together as a group. \nTo reserve your place at lunch\, please contact Connie McMurray at (707) 799-9366.
URL:https://cslsr.org/event/seniors-in-spirit/2026-08-11/
CATEGORIES:Seniors in Spirit
